🧩 Murakkab topshiriq: “Order System API”
📌 Vazifa

Siz online do‘kon uchun buyurtma tizimi (Order System) yaratasiz.

🏗 1. Model struktura

Quyidagi modellarni yarating:

🔹 Product
name
price
stock

🔹 Customer
name
email

🔹 Order
customer (ForeignKey)
created_at
status (choices: pending, completed)

🔹 OrderItem
order (ForeignKey)
product (ForeignKey)
quantity

⚠️ 2. Asosiy talab (ENG MUHIM QISM)
🔥 Nested Serializer ishlatish

Order yaratishda quyidagi JSON keladi:

{
  "customer": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "product": 2,
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
      "product": 5,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
📌 3. Serializer talablar
🧠 OrderSerializer:
🔹 Nested yozish
items = OrderItemSerializer(many=True)
🔹 create() override qilish

Custom create() yozing va:

Order yarating
Har bir item uchun:
productni oling
agar quantity > stock → error
stockni kamaytiring
OrderItem yarating
🔹 update() override
Order update bo‘lganda:
eski itemlarni o‘chiring
yangilarini qayta yarating
stockni TO‘G‘RI qayta hisoblang
🔹 Validation
Agar items bo‘sh bo‘lsa → error
Bir order ichida bir xil product 2 marta kelmasin
📊 4. Read-only qo‘shimcha fieldlar

OrderSerializer ichida:

total_price → barcha itemlar summasi
total_items → itemlar soni
📌 5. Advanced
🔥 Transaction ishlatish

Agar birorta item xato bo‘lsa:
👉 BUTUN order rollback bo‘lsin

(django.db.transaction.atomic)

🔥 Representation override

Response quyidagicha chiqsin:

{
  "id": 1,
  "customer": "Ali",
  "items": [
    {
      "product": "iPhone",
      "quantity": 2,
      "subtotal": 2000
    }
  ],
  "total_price": 2000
}








🧩 Osonroq topshiriq: “Student API”
📌 1. Model yaratish

Student modeli:

name (CharField)
age (IntegerField)
grade (CharField, masalan: A, B, C)
is_active (BooleanField, default=True)
created_at (DateTimeField, auto_now_add=True)
📌 2. Serializer yozish

StudentSerializer:

🔹 Maydonlar:
barcha fieldlar
qo‘shimcha:
is_adult (agar age ≥ 18 bo‘lsa True)
🔹 Validation:
age 5 dan kichik bo‘lmasin
grade faqat: A, B, C bo‘lsin
📌 3. Filter qo‘shish (eng muhim qism)

APIView yoki ListAPIView da quyidagi filterlarni qo‘sh:

🔍 Query params:
?name=ali → name ichida borlarini qaytar
?grade=A → faqat A grade
?min_age=18 → age ≥ 18
?active=true → faqat active studentlar
📌 4. Endpoint
GET /students/ → filter bilan
POST /students/ → yangi student
📌 5. Bonus (oson, lekin foydali)
ordering qo‘sh:
?ordering=age
?ordering=-created_at
🔥 Misol request
/students/?name=ali&grade=A&min_age=18&active=true



--------------




🔎 5. Filter va Search

django-filter ishlatib:

Filter:
is_published bo‘yicha filter
created_at range filter
Search:
title
content
🧠 6. View (ViewSet yoki APIView)

PostViewSet yarating:

CRUD ishlasin
Filter + Search qo‘shing
Author avtomatik request.user bo‘lsin
🛠 7. Admin panel

Admin.py da:

Post modelni register qiling
List display:
title
author
is_published
Search:
title
Filter:
is_published
⭐️ 8. Qo‘shimcha (Advanced)

Agar kuchliroq qilishni xohlasangiz:

Pagination qo‘shing
Ordering (created_at)




