ISHGA
🚀 Advanced Topshiriq: Multi-User Blog + Interaction API
🎯 Maqsad:

Quyidagi barcha tushunchalarni real loyihadagidek ishlatish:

Murakkab model relationlar
Custom serializer logic
Advanced filter/search
JWT + role based permission
Admin customization
🧩 1. Model struktura (murakkabroq)

Quyidagi modellerni yarat:

👤 User (custom user bo‘lsa yaxshi)
username
email
role (ADMIN, AUTHOR, READER)
📝 Post
title
content
author (FK → User)
category (FK → Category)
tags (ManyToMany → Tag)
is_published
views_count
created_at
🗂 Category
name
🏷 Tag
name
❤️ Like
user
post

👉 Constraint qo‘shing:

1 user 1 postga faqat 1 marta like bosishi mumkin
🔄 2. Serializer (advanced logic)
PostSerializer:
author read-only
likes_count (annotate yoki method field)
is_liked (request.user ga qarab)
tags nested yoki slug orqali

👉 Bonus:

create/update da taglarni avtomatik create qilsin
🔐 3. JWT Auth

djangorestframework-simplejwt

Qo‘shimcha:

Custom token ichiga role qo‘shing
🔑 4. Permission (murakkab)

Custom permission yoz:

Rules:
ADMIN → hamma narsani qila oladi
AUTHOR → faqat o‘z postini edit/delete
READER → faqat o‘qiydi

👉 Custom class yoz (IsAuthorOrAdmin kabi)

🔎 5. Advanced Filter/Search

django-filter

Filter:
category
tags (multi filter)
created_at range
views_count > X
Search:
title
content
Ordering:
created_at
views_count
likes_count
⚡ 6. ViewSet (pro level)
PostViewSet:
CRUD
/like/ custom action
/unlike/ custom action
/popular/ → eng ko‘p ko‘rilgan postlar
/my-posts/ → user postlari

👉 views_count:

retrieve qilinganda +1 bo‘lsin
🛠 7. Admin panel (pro customization)

Admin’da:

Inline Like ko‘rsatish
list_display:
title, author, views_count, is_published
filter:
category, is_published
search:
title, content

👉 Bonus:

views_count ni readonly qiling
🧠 8. Performance (important)
select_related
prefetch_related
annotate bilan likes_count
📄 9. Default Settings
DEFAULT_PERMISSION → IsAuthenticated
Pagination (limit/offset)
Throttling qo‘shish (optional)



