🟢 EASY — “Product Catalog API (Post o‘rniga Product)”
📌 Vazifa

Blog emas — e-commerce product API yozish.

📦 Model
Category
name
Product
title
description
price
category FK
is_active
created_at
Favorite (Like o‘rnida)
user
product
unique(user, product)
⚙️ Serializer talablar

ProductSerializer:

favorites_count (annotated)
is_favorited (annotated)
category_name (read_only field)
📌 Shartlar
ModelSerializer ishlatilsin
SerializerMethodField ishlatilsin
get_favorites_count annotation orqali kelishi kerak
get_is_favorited userga bog‘liq bo‘lsin
🎯 Maqsad

👉 Post/Like patternni Product/Favorite ga ko‘chira olish




