🟡 MEDIUM — “Course platform (Tag o‘rniga Skill)”
📌 Vazifa

Blog o‘rniga online course system

📦 Model
Skill
name
Course
title
description
instructor (User FK)
skills (M2M)
students_count (annotated field emas, real count)
is_published
Enrollment (Like o‘rniga)
user
course
unique constraint
⚙️ API
Course endpoints:
CRUD
Actions:
POST /courses/<id>/enroll/
POST /courses/<id>/unenroll/
📌 Serializer talablar

CourseSerializer:

skills (list of strings input)
students_count (annotate yoki reverse count)
is_enrolled (userga bog‘liq boolean)
📌 Business logic
skill get_or_create
M2M set qilish
enroll duplicate bo‘lmasin
🎯 Maqsad

👉 Tag system → Skill system transform qilish


